# English-only code

All **code** in this repository must be written in English.

## Must be English

- Identifiers: modules, packages, classes, functions, variables, constants
- Comments and docstrings
- Log messages, exceptions, and `HTTPException` / API `detail` strings
- OpenAPI titles, descriptions, and Field descriptions
- Commit messages and PR titles when authored in this project

## Allowed exceptions

- Domain quotes inside Jinja few-shot examples (e.g. fictional client text) may stay in Spanish if they simulate real meeting language
- User-facing README sections may be bilingual only when documenting for Spanish-speaking readers; prefer English for technical sections

## Examples

```python
# ❌ BAD
def generar_estimacion(descripcion: str) -> str:
    """Genera una estimación a partir de la descripción."""
    raise ValueError("Falta la clave del proveedor")

# ✅ GOOD
def generate_estimation(description: str) -> str:
    """Generate an estimation from the project description."""
    raise ValueError("Missing provider API key")
```

When editing existing Spanish identifiers or messages in code, rename/translate them to English in the same change unless the user asks otherwise.
